DOOM source licence note
========================

The files in this directory are a port of id Software's Linux DOOM source
(linuxdoom-1.10). Many file headers still carry the original 1997 "DOOM Source
Code License" text.

On 1999-10-03 id Software re-released the DOOM source code under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 (or later). That GPL release supersedes the
older DOOM Source Code License, and this port is distributed under the
GPL-2.0-or-later terms. See ../LICENSE for the full GPL-2.0 text.

The game data (doom1.wad / doom.wad) is NOT covered by this and is NOT included
in this repository. The shareware doom1.wad may be obtained separately; copy it
next to doom.exe (or into the install image) yourself.